{"version":1,"content":"<p>東京大學近日開發出一種納米網格皮膚傳感器，其網狀外觀讓社交媒體用户聯想到《賽博朋克2077》的賽博義體、《真·女神轉生3》的人修羅以及《鬼滅之刃》的猗窩座。這並非遊戲產品或身體改造技術，而是一種仍處於研究階段的可穿戴設備。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587200.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:03:58.634509+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:49:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.137144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.137144+00:00","content_hash":"060bf241a00e6404630a9553f912c6b0e5e80ec32085c939667a1ae71fa81419","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}